@startuml
title Вариант B — основной сценарий Temporal Workflow
autonumber

actor "Банковский сервис" as Source
participant "Notification API" as API
database "Idempotency Registry" as Registry
participant "Temporal Cluster" as Temporal
participant "Delivery Workflow Worker" as Workflow
participant "Preference Activity" as Pref
participant "Template Activity" as Template
participant "Push Activity" as Push
participant "Push Provider" as Provider
participant "Мобильное приложение" as App
participant "Callback Gateway" as Callback

Source -> API: POST notification + idempotency_key
API -> Registry: INSERT unique(source, key, notification_id)
API -> Temporal: StartWorkflow(workflowId = notification_id)
Temporal -> Temporal: durable save WorkflowExecutionStarted
Temporal --> API: workflow accepted
API --> Source: 202 Accepted + notification_id

Temporal -> Workflow: workflow task
Workflow -> Pref: Activity getPreferences(user_id)
Pref --> Workflow: push token + route
Workflow -> Template: Activity render(template, locale)
Template --> Workflow: push content
Workflow -> Push: Activity sendPush(attempt_id, content)
Push -> Provider: send(idempotency_key)
Provider --> Push: accepted + provider_message_id
Push --> Workflow: provider accepted
Workflow -> Temporal: start durable timer 3 сек, await signal
Provider -> App: push
App -> Callback: app acknowledgement
Callback -> Temporal: SignalWorkflow(PUSH_DELIVERED)
Temporal -> Workflow: signal event
Workflow -> Temporal: CompleteWorkflow(DELIVERED via PUSH)

Source -> API: GET /notifications/{id}
API -> Temporal: QueryWorkflow
Temporal --> API: DELIVERED
API --> Source: DELIVERED via PUSH

note over API,Temporal
Workflow history и timer сохраняются durable.
После рестарта новый worker продолжит процесс.
end note

note over Workflow,Push
Activity retry встроен, но сама Activity
всё равно использует idempotency key.
end note
@enduml
